# Advanced stress test for collection types (ArrayList, HashMap, HashSet).
# Performs extensive insertions, lookups, and aggregations across massive datasets
# to benchmark collection resizing, memory throughput, and hashing performance.
# Includes elapsed time tracking per individual phase.
